Data
----
Demand calibration rests on quarter-hourly meter records from two Beninese villages,
collected for this work. The behavioural archetypes derived from them are shipped with the
model and are documented in data/ramp_params/reference/.

Meteorological series are derived from ERA5-Land, produced by the Copernicus Climate
Change Service (C3S) at ECMWF. Neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible
for any use of the Copernicus information this project makes.

Climate pathways are derived from CMIP6 downscaled projections; their provenance is
recorded in data/irradiance/README.md.

Load profiles are generated with RAMP (https://github.com/RAMP-project/RAMP), which is
declared as a dependency and is not redistributed here.
